# Options list with Audio highlighted -> Display (1 DOWN, CROSS): rows Crosshair, HUD, Subtitles, Hints, Brightness.
# Toggle Subtitles (row 3) with RIGHT, then Brightness (4 DOWN from the top) opens the gamma page: LEFT x4, RIGHT x8.
key DOWN
sleep 2
key X
sleep 4
